    <div class="npm-packages">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>NPM Packages and Libraries used</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>express</li>
                <p>web Framework for Node.js</p>
                <li>express-handlebars</li>
                <p>handlebars view engine needed for Handlebars template in Express</p>
                <li>body-parser</li>
                <p>middleware that handles the request and response objects</p>
                <li>mongoose</li>
                <p>ODM library for MongoDB and Node.js</p>
                <li>multer</li>
                <p>middleware for file upload management</p>
                <li>express-session</li>
                <p>middleware session handler for express web application</p>
                <li>bcrypt</li>
                <p>library that allows to hash passwords and secure them in database storage</p>
                <li>connect-mongodb-session</li>
                <p>stores session data in MongoDB</p>
                <li>path</li>
                <p>provides utilities for working with file and directory paths</p>
                <li>dotenv</li>
                <p>allows loading of environment variables from a . env file into the Node. js application and keeps sensitive data out of the source code</p>
                <li>render</li>
                <p>a free hosting service for web applications that can use the github repository as the code and mongodb atlas as its cloud database</p>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

